📖 About the course
This is a free, complete ERPNext course. It starts from zero. No accounting knowledge, no ERP knowledge and no technical background are assumed. Every module builds on the one before it, on a single live system that we set up on camera and keep using through to a closed financial year. The course can also be used as study material for the ERPNext Certification.

